(# TP3 course validation) Tj T*
() Tj T*
(The course source is `Tp03-2026.pdf` in `/home/rodrigo/facultad/compi`.) Tj T*
(This validation covers every example and requirement applicable to group 24,) Tj T*
(plus the confirmed decisions and regression cases for their interactions.) Tj T*
(References are attached to the executable scenarios in) Tj T*
(`tests/tp3_course_cases.py`; `tests/verify_tp3_course.py` checks them independently) Tj T*
(of the compiler's exit-status summary.) Tj T*
() Tj T*
