BT /F1 8 Tf 36 756 Td 10 TL
(1. Cached calls restored unrelated compile-time bindings from their original) Tj T*
(   environment. Effect replay now updates only actual effects; repeated calls) Tj T*
(   inside expanded loops no longer roll the caller's counter backward.) Tj T*
(2. Known nonlocal runtime writes were discarded after a call. Proven final) Tj T*
(   values are propagated, so a function that sets the FROM control variable to a) Tj T*
(   known bound does not make the compile-time loop spuriously unknown.) Tj T*
(3. Indexed writes and whole-object copies involving compile-time fields were) Tj T*
(   missing from call-effect summaries. Summaries now include them, preserving) Tj T*
(   updates, driving loop expansion and preventing a cached call from bypassing) Tj T*
(   the unknown-control rule.) Tj T*
(4. Object argument copies lost compile-time fields or read them after subsequent) Tj T*
(   arguments had changed the source. Bindings are captured at the argument copy,) Tj T*
(   and separate activation environments receive the captured field values.) Tj T*
(5. A compile-time source field had no runtime value available when copied into) Tj T*
(   a compatible ordinary field. MATERIALIZE retains a logical object value with) Tj T*
(   constant-field snapshots in TS metadata, while runtime destinations continue) Tj T*
(   to omit compile-time storage.) Tj T*
() Tj T*
(The tests also exposed limitations in the original oracle: local-class methods) Tj T*
(needed the correct enclosing lexical frame; integer division and floating-point) Tj T*
(rounding needed the assigned representations; literal/symbol category collisions) Tj T*
(needed separate interpretation; and object copies needed the effective schema.) Tj T*
(Those oracle corrections remain distinct from compiler corrections.) Tj T*
() Tj T*
(## Reproduction) Tj T*
() Tj T*
(```bash) Tj T*
(./run_tests.sh) Tj T*
(python3 tests/verify_tp3_course.py --case comptime_loop) Tj T*
(python3 tests/verify_tp3_course.py --report docs/tp3_test_results.json) Tj T*
(```) Tj T*
() Tj T*
(Both suites are also run with ASan, UBSan and leak detection. In this environment) Tj T*
(Clang supplies the installed sanitizer runtime, and LeakSanitizer requires running) Tj T*
(outside the restricted sandbox to inspect process state.) Tj T*
